    <dcterms:abstract xml:lang="en">The Privacy Consent on FHIR (PCF) Profile supports the use of a FHIR Consent resource to capture, discover, and enforce patient privacy consent directives across healthcare actors using the Access Consent [ITI-108] transaction and progressive Basic, Intermediate, and Advanced Consent profiles.</dcterms:abstract>
