    <dcterms:language xsi:type="dcterms:RFC4646">en</dcterms:language>
    <dcterms:abstract xml:lang="en">The Verifiable Health Links (VHL) Profile specifies actors (VHL Holder, VHL Sharer, VHL Receiver, Trust Anchor) and transactions ([ITI-YY1] Submit PKI Material with DID, [ITI-YY2] Retrieve Trust List with DID, [ITI-YY3] Generate VHL, [ITI-YY4] Provide VHL, [ITI-YY5] Retrieve Manifest) for issuing, presenting, verifying, and redeeming cryptographically verifiable links to health documents in a trust-anchor-neutral manner.</dcterms:abstract>
    <dcterms:type>document</dcterms:type>
  </metadata>
